=========================================================================
WIRE 5 -- the prime-pair chart, run by machine/MathMachine.hs.

Verbatim machine/machine.log excerpts, 2026-08-18, ghc 9.4.7, Agda 2.6.3
with the cubical library, on this machine.  Nothing here is edited except
that each run is preceded by the command that produced it.

ARM 0 is the A/B for the one change this work makes to the DEFAULT engine
(proveByInduction now installs the induction hypothesis in normalised form
as well as stated form).  ARMs A and B are the pair chart.
=========================================================================


